    {
      "title": "How It Works",
      "content": "Privtrans uses a combination of <strong>static analysis</strong> and <strong>dynamic information</strong> to identify privileged operations and partition the program accordingly. It also provides a <strong>RPC mechanism</strong> for communication between the monitor and slave, and a <strong>storage mechanism</strong> for storing the results of privileged operations.",
